{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/reeman-living-aldar-al-shamkhah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":729,"crm_id":"229","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Reeman Living","slug":"reeman-living-aldar-al-shamkhah","display_address":"Al Shamkhah","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Aldar Properties","price":713504,"display_price":"713K","lattitude":24.4022944,"longitude":54.676638,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Reeman Living - an innovative project that is the perfect combination of spacious and modern apartments, impeccable architecture and luxurious amenities. The complex features thoughtfully designed and functional layouts that include elegant <strong>studios and luxurious 1-3 bedroom apartments</strong>. The interiors utilise the highest quality materials in two shade options, light and dark.</p><p>Reeman Living offers a wide range of amenities that contribute to an exceptional lifestyle. Residents can enjoy the rooftop greenhouse where fresh fruits and vegetables can be grown, relax on the green spaces with ponds and fountains, visit the fitness centre with state-of-the-art equipment, relax in the sauna or enjoy stunning city views from the common rooftop terrace.</p><p>In addition to the on-site amenities, the complex's appeal lies in its prime location. Reeman Living is close to parks, shopping centres, restaurants, sports facilities and the beautiful beaches of Abu Dhabi. Al Shamkha Mall, Makani Al Shamkha Mall, Al Shamkha Nursery and Bonat Al Ghad Kindergarten are just 5 minutes away, while Yas Island and The Mainland of Abu Dhabi are approximately 30 minutes away by car.</p><p>Reeman Living is the epitome of luxury and contemporary living, characterised by high quality construction and attention to detail. It offers the perfect balance of spacious living spaces, stylish design and impressive amenities to ensure the comfort and well-being of its residents.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_2355ddc5f8.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_2355ddc5f8","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_3614e57f9e.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_3614e57f9e","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_8690d967c1.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_8690d967c1","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_0387ef9189.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_0387ef9189","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_898a0a7374.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_898a0a7374","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_66d89a655d.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_66d89a655d","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkhah"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_3c4924341d.jpg","hash":"Reeman_Living_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Al_Shamkhah_3c4924341d","name":"Reeman Living by Aldar Properties in Al Shamkh